### 3.2 Stazione A — Ingest

**Cosa**: acquisizione dati da fonti multiple.

**Fonti**: StatsBomb Open Data (eventi completi con coordinate), FBref (statistiche aggregate), Understat (xG, xA, PPDA), Transfermarkt (rose, formazioni), dataset storico Serie A (PDDL v1.0, match-level 1990-oggi), collezione globale dataset (30 dataset open), kloppy (standardizzazione eventi e tracking).

**Funzioni**:

```python
# StatsBomb
ingest_statsbomb_matches(competition_id, season_id) -> List[Match]
ingest_statsbomb_events(match_id) -> List[Event]
ingest_statsbomb_360(match_id) -> List[Frame]
ingest_statsbomb_lineups(match_id) -> List[Player]

# FBref
ingest_fbref_team_stats(team, season) -> DataFrame
ingest_fbref_player_stats(player, season) -> DataFrame
ingest_fbref_schedule(team, season) -> DataFrame

# Understat
ingest_understat_shots(match_id) -> DataFrame
ingest_understat_players(team, season) -> DataFrame

# Dataset storico Serie A (PDDL)
ingest_datahub_serie_a(start_season, end_season) -> DataFrame

# Collezione globale
ingest_global_datasets_index() -> List[DatasetLink]
discover_datasets(query) -> List[DatasetLink]

# kloppy
standardize_event_data(raw_data, provider) -> EventDataset
standardize_tracking_data(raw_data, provider) -> TrackingDataset
```

